                                                "sense_id": "a3d00d90-0276-39b2-91ac-f6365b65532e",
                                                "text": "'In short,' concluded the parson, decisively smacking his leg with his switch, 'there's hardly such another family in England.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1a90f27d-9107-48a3-811c-ad1661e68a36",
                                                "sense_id": "a3d00d90-0276-39b2-91ac-f6365b65532e",
                                                "text": "The visitors rallied again though and struck decisively 16 minutes from time when Yaya Toure headed in the winner."
